  message: "OWNER RATIFIED 2026-09-23: R2 with the panel's wording (see the PANEL RESULT entry above). The axiom is: a row's kind says how the primitive is reached from the row's own module. methods iff it is called on an instance of module; functions iff it is called on module itself (namespace, package, type, companion object, named global) or has no owner; attributes iff it is read, not called. Proceeding in the panel's order, starting with step 2 (INV-dihun: JS process, python ctypes.cdll), which nothing blocks."  # edb0
