  message: "STEP 1 DONE (PR #1157, ADR-0059): the axis is declared with ADR-0024's four artifacts.\n- Registry and predicates: io_primitive_kinds.\n- Consumers: 18 literal sites converted, no behaviour change.\n- Static check: find_kind_literal_drift, run by check-io-boundary-drift.\n- Property tests: test_io_primitive_kinds.py.\nThe 91 non-conforming rows sit in a shrink-only ledger, each naming its blocker (INV-pimir, WI-kilap, WI-narij, INV-gujoh, WI-ziviv).\nNext in order: step 3 (swift constructor boundaries, INV-gujoh), step 4 (the INV-nizom arm), step 5 (WI-kilap), step 6 (JVM statics), step 7 (INV-pimir statement and the starvation docstring). WI-ziviv (objc, swift statics, FilesKt) is unconstrained and can go at any point."  # 00a6
